  "body": "Stacked on #2259 (#2247). Retarget this PR to `main` before #2259 merges.\n\n## What changed\n\n- New `crates/app/src/operation/selection_memo.rs`. It keeps the answers of the selection walk for the display: the account notes, the door refusal and the Contour Auto side.\n- The key is the input itself (rule 2 of `docs/decisions/2238-frame-cost-rule.md`), never `doc_version`:\n  - the setup, the picks and the parameters, by value;\n  - for each picked entity and the setup's stock: the entity, the `Facets` allocation, the `Location`, and the setup alignment flag;\n  - for the setup: the effective setup, the `SetupDef`, the machine kind, the WCS pose and word;\n  - the document unit.\n- `operation::selection_account` (Geometry tab) and `operation::contour_auto_side` (Contour fields) read the memo. The two share one entry, so one walk serves the two.\n- `selection_walks()` counts the real walks. `contour_auto_side_fresh` and `selection_account_fresh` walk without the memo, for the pins.\n- Decision: `docs/decisions/2248-selection-walk.md`.\n\n## Safety (rule 6)\n\nGeneration reads the side from its own walk in `job` (`selection_geometry_impl`). The pick doors (`selection_refusal`) and the region walk (`selection_geometry`) also walk for themselves. The generator and the post do not read this memo. The side that the toolpath uses does not change. No cut geometry, chain or golden changed.\n\n## Readings\n\nRelease, fig8, state b (#2238 probe), before: `selection_account` 4.24-4.48 ms and `contour_auto_side` 4.13-4.45 ms on each still frame. After: 0 walks on a still frame (debug probe count). The release table for the full stack goes on #2238 after the last piece (#2250).\n\n## Pinning tests\n\n- `egui_app::tests::frame_cost_caches::contour_side_and_account_walk_once_per_input`. Each answer equals a fresh walk. The test changes each input: each top chain alone, undo, all chains again, side Inside through `EditOperationParams` and undo, `MoveModel` of fig8 and undo.\n- `egui_app::tests::frame_cost_probe::still_frames_on_fig8_name_their_costs`: `selections` = 0 in states a-e.\n\n## Gate\n\n- `camcraft-app` lib (356 passed) and tests `area_controls area_open blind_slot circular_pick face_holes open_band operations opframe_picks pick_doors probe_pick project_roundtrip shoulder_adaptive slot_caps slot_picks solid_law_goldens stitch_cross tilt units_in_refusals`: all pass.\n- `camcraft-ui` lib: 971 passed, 6 ignored.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-ui --all-targets -- -D warnings`: clean.\n- `cargo clippy -p camcraft-app --lib --test pick_doors --test operations -- -D warnings`: clean.\n- `main` is red in `crates/app/tests/wire_tool.rs` (E0063: missing fields `stepdown` and `stepover` in `CuttingRow`). This is not from this PR, so `--all-targets` for `camcraft-app` was not run.\n\n## Not exercised\n\n- A change of the stock entity or of the setup alignment and WCS tilt with an open page (the key holds them, but no test changes them).\n- Facing and pocket kinds through the memo (the pins use a Contour).\n\nChangelog: Performance: the Geometry tab and the Contour fields no longer walk the selection again on each frame.\n\nEffort: high (no escalation).\n\nFixes #2248\nFixes #2249\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n",
